" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Turrets\">Turrets</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Turrets druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 1</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Landmines\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Landmines\">Landmines</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Landmines druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 1</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Entities\">Entities</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DominantIndoorEntity(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DominantIndoorEntity(s)\">Dominant Indoor Entity(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DominantIndoorEntity(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nDroop</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DominantOutdoorEntity(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DominantOutdoorEntity(s)\">Dominant Outdoor Entity(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DominantOutdoorEntity(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nDroop</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DaytimePower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DaytimePower\">Daytime Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DaytimePower druid-data-nonempty\">\n0</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-ExteriorPower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-ExteriorPower\">Exterior Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-ExteriorPower druid-data-nonempty\">\n6</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InteriorPower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorPower\">Interior Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorPower druid-data-nonempty\">\n14</div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"tocleft\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Map\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Map</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Info\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Info</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Environment\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Environment</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Xenphir&#39;s_Light_Explosions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Xenphir's Light Explosions</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Exclusive_Content\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Exclusive Content</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Droop\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Droop</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Progression\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Progression</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Unlocked_By\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Unlocked By</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Unlocks\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Unlocks</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Loot_Table\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Loot Table</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Entities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Entities</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawns_(Interior)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Interior)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawns_(Exterior)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Exterior)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Lore\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Lore</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>The shadows cry for their light was snuffed out.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Map\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Map\">&gt; Moon Map</span></h2>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Info\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Info\">&gt; Moon Info</span></h2>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\"><b>POPULATION:</b> Vanished.<br /><br /><b>CONDITIONS:</b> Cold, rocky terrain, strange formations and high levels of V-Radiation.<br /><br /><b>FAUNA:</b> A dead ecosystem, strange figures present.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Environment\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Environment\">&gt; Environment</span></h2>\n<p><b>Xenphir</b> is a rocky, dark, and desolate moon, with the most visibile signs of a prior ecosystem being the dead grass, bushes, and trees scattered across the terrain. Even the sun above <b>Xenphir</b> appears to be dead, as it provides no light by itself and the exterior only lights up when strange explosions of light that sound similar to lightning occur. Craters of purple, starry matter as well as strange rock formations can be found across the landscape as well.\n</p><p>Several houses can be found around the moon, most of which are fire exits. A much larger house can be found west of and behind the ship, which is the main entrance. The previous residents who lived here have all been reduced to the shadowy figures with glowing white eyes that vanish when approaching them or have been turned into the <a href=\"/wiki/Droop\" title=\"Droop\"><b>Droop</b></a>.\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Xenphir.27s_Light_Explosions\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Xenphir's_Light_Explosions\">Xenphir's Light Explosions</span></h3>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Audio\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Light Explosion\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"8\" data-mwtitle=\"XenExplosion1.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/XenExplosion1.mp3?fc4328\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/XenExplosion1.mp3/XenExplosion1.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"9\" data-mwtitle=\"XenExplosion2.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/XenExplosion2.mp3?41f451\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/XenExplosion2.mp3/XenExplosion2.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"9\" data-mwtitle=\"XenExplosion3.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/XenExplosion3.mp3?1271ac\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/XenExplosion3.mp3/XenExplosion3.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"10\" data-mwtitle=\"XenExplosion4.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/XenExplosion4.mp3?3d2bfa\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/XenExplosion4.mp3/XenExplosion4.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"15\" data-mwtitle=\"XenExplosion5.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/XenExplosion5.mp3?a7f9db\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/XenExplosion5.mp3/XenExplosion5.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"9\" data-mwtitle=\"XenExplosion6.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/XenExplosion6.mp3?c54ca9\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/XenExplosion6.mp3/XenExplosion6.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"10\" data-mwtitle=\"XenExplosion7.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/XenExplosion7.mp3?be1386\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/XenExplosion7.mp3/XenExplosion7.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Exclusive_Content\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Exclusive_Content\">&gt; Moon Exclusive Content</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Droop\">Droop</span></h3>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/Droop\" title=\"Droop\"><b>Droop</b></a> is an entity unique to Xenphir that can spawn on both the exterior and within the interior. It is a variant of the Barber that is always visible, does not speed up as time progress, and has has a max count of 12 instead of 1. It will deal 100 damage to and temporarily blind players with a white light if they get between its hands.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Progression\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Progression\">&gt; Progression</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unlocked_By\">Unlocked By</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Crafting a \"Blank floppy disc\" on <a href=\"/wiki/Galetry\" title=\"Galetry\">Galetry</a>, inserting it into the Floppy Disc Machine found on the exterior of <a href=\"/wiki/Dormant\" title=\"Dormant\">Dormant</a>, and logging the \"Xenphir floppy disc\".</span></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unlocks\">Unlocks</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span><a href=\"/wiki/ResearcherxB\" title=\"ResearcherxB\"><big><b>ResearcherxB:</b></big></a> Xenphir can be one of the random moons that requires placing a Triangulation Device on its exterior.</span></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Loot_Table\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Loot_Table\">&gt; Loot Table</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Scrap Items\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Scrap Name</th>\n<th>Image</th>\n<th>Conductive</th>\n<th>Weight (lbs)</th>\n<th>Min Value</th>\n<th>Avg Value</th>\n<th>Max Value</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th>Spawn Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bag of Clothes</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:BagOfClothesPH.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"BagOfClothesPH.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/BagOfClothesPH.png/60px-BagOfClothesPH.png?73c72f\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/BagOfClothesPH.png/90px-BagOfClothesPH.png?73c72f 1.5x, /images/thumb/BagOfClothesPH.png/120px-BagOfClothesPH.png?73c72f 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>36</td>\n<td>46</td>\n<td>56</td>\n<td>30</td>\n<td>7.19%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bottles</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bottles.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Bottles.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Bottles.png/60px-Bottles.png?7ec3b7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Bottles.png/90px-Bottles.png?7ec3b7 1.5x, /images/thumb/Bottles.png/120px-Bottles.png?7ec3b7 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>19</td>